# Content files

These files are canonical. UI must match them.

- Frontmatter fields follow [docs/content-model.md](docs/content-model.md). Do not add marketing fields that imply fake scale (`downloads`, `users`, `featuredOn`).
- Kanvra: do not add analytics, ads, accounts, or IAP to copy unless BRIEF changes.
- Status `coming-soon` only if it is actually shipping.
- After editing a product file, update any page that imports it in the same change.
